stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> off
  off --> requested: staff activate
  requested --> starting: provider accepted
  starting --> ready: warm probe passed
  starting --> starting: still warming
  starting --> degraded: remote path fails after prior readiness
  ready --> degraded: timeout/auth/upstream/malformed response
  ready --> stopping: staff stop
  ready --> off: auto-stop on expiry or idle
  degraded --> starting: provider recovers but warm probe still pending
  degraded --> ready: refresh + warm probe passed
  degraded --> off: staff stop or auto-stop
  stopping --> off: stop confirmed
  stopping --> error: stop failed
  requested --> error: activation failed
  starting --> error: bridge/health failure
  error --> off: explicit recovery or successful reconciliation
